				That depends on the tip guard you have or if you are wanting a new type of tip you may need a new guard to accommodate it. Graco RAC X airless spray tips, LTX
				(blue), FFT (green), WR (blue) only fit the Graco RAC X guard (blue). Graco RAC IV, RAC 5 (black) and LL5 (yellow) fit the Graco orange tip guards
			</p>
